{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. Let's get today's project huddle started. As you all know, the school has approved the concept of building a twelve-bed teaching garden beside the science wing, and I have final authority to approve the construction, purchasing, and safety plan. The current draft plan calls for in-ground beds, a volunteer workday on October 18, a $3,000 charge to general funds, and standard latex gardening gloves. Before I can sign off on this campus project plan, I need each of you to report on any requirements you've verified. Let's start with the science teacher -- what can you tell me about the site and any academic requirements?"}
```

```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF4", "text": "I need to report a student-safety requirement. My student health review, which I completed this week after the draft equipment list was prepared, identified a documented severe latex allergy among the students scheduled for garden instruction. Our school safety protocol therefore requires nitrile-only gloves instead of the standard latex gardening gloves currently listed in the draft plan, and we also need an allergy-safety notice posted at the garden entrance. This means the equipment list must be revised to replace all latex gloves with nitrile gloves before the plan can be approved."}
```

