{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "I need to share an important site requirement before we proceed. I just received the soil test results yesterday from the proposed garden area, and the lead measurement came back at 180 parts per million. According to the district garden standard, at that reading we are required to remove the top six inches of soil and use raised beds instead of in-ground beds. This result came in after the draft plan was circulated, so I haven't entered it in the project folder yet, but it clearly affects our current plan's use of in-ground beds."}
```

